//! stage: lex
// Malformed character literals.
'' //~ ERROR empty character literal
'ab' //~ ERROR exactly one character
'a //~ ERROR unterminated character literal
'\q' //~ ERROR unknown escape sequence `\q`
'\xZ1' //~ ERROR invalid `\x` escape
'\x4' //~ ERROR invalid `\x` escape
'\u41' //~ ERROR expected `{`
'\u{}' //~ ERROR 1 to 6 hexadecimal digits
'\u{D800}' //~ ERROR surrogate
'\u{110000}' //~ ERROR above U+10FFFF
'\u{41' //~ ERROR expected `}`
